WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:41.240
Prune them.

01:41.320 --> 01:42.880
Don't just prune this one.

01:42.960 --> 01:44.240
Tong'er, stop playing with water.

01:44.320 --> 01:45.800
Hurry up and water these.

01:46.280 --> 01:48.000
You, wipe the posts.

01:48.080 --> 01:49.560
Wipe all eight posts down.

01:49.640 --> 01:50.480
You…

01:50.560 --> 01:51.680
Come.

01:51.760 --> 01:52.960
Put them here, on the ground.

01:53.040 --> 01:54.840
Then put one here
and another here. Understand?

01:54.920 --> 01:55.960
- Yes.
- Xiangqiao.

01:56.520 --> 01:57.560
My lady.

02:06.480 --> 02:08.759
This is my favorite bracelet.

02:08.840 --> 02:10.039
It's so nice.

02:12.720 --> 02:15.080
What a perfect fit.

02:15.160 --> 02:17.960
- It's…
- It's so beautiful.

02:18.520 --> 02:19.840
Bootlicker.

02:20.800 --> 02:21.720
Thank you, my lady.

02:24.800 --> 02:25.640
My lady.

02:25.720 --> 02:26.560
You must be thirsty.

02:26.640 --> 02:29.080
Should I get you some tea and pastries?

02:29.160 --> 02:30.280
- Sure.
- You guys!

02:30.800 --> 02:32.440
What's with the flower placement?

02:32.520 --> 02:33.440
They look so ugly.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.960
Who told you to place them that way?

02:35.720 --> 02:36.800
Rearrange them!

02:36.880 --> 02:37.720
Flower planting?

02:38.760 --> 02:40.000
What flowers?

02:40.080 --> 02:41.920
Just some common garden peonies,
tree peonies,

02:42.000 --> 02:43.040
and chrysanthemums.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.000
Pretty common.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.720
But it's

02:45.800 --> 02:46.640
quite a lot.

02:46.720 --> 02:48.640
I heard that Xiangqiao and Yunshuang

02:48.720 --> 02:49.880
moved them back and forth

02:49.960 --> 02:51.200
to fill the courtyard.

02:51.760 --> 02:53.240
It's still something to talk about.

02:54.280 --> 02:56.600
Ask everyone in the Jiang Residence to say

02:56.680 --> 02:59.680
that Ms. Jiang Li is making a mess
as soon as she's back.

02:59.760 --> 03:01.440
Not only does she squander money,

03:01.520 --> 03:03.560
she also mistreats servants.

03:03.640 --> 03:04.840
Got it.

03:05.720 --> 03:07.800
Is the gift for Mr. Shen ready?

03:07.880 --> 03:08.920
Yes. Come.

03:10.480 --> 03:11.320
Take a look.

03:11.800 --> 03:14.440
These are the best snacks
in the Ji family. Here.

03:17.280 --> 03:19.200
The credit for compiling the book
goes to you.

03:19.280 --> 03:22.320
I just shared some ideas with you.

03:23.360 --> 03:25.240
It makes us look distant

03:25.320 --> 03:26.920
that you came to offer thanks.

03:30.040 --> 03:31.560
Without your guidance,

03:32.040 --> 03:34.040
I would not have been able
to satisfy His Majesty.

03:34.120 --> 03:36.000
I'm honored to pay you a visit

03:36.080 --> 03:37.240
and take this opportunity

03:37.320 --> 03:39.480
to thank you for your help.

03:41.320 --> 03:42.400
Are you done talking?

03:46.840 --> 03:49.920
My husband often compliments you

03:50.000 --> 03:52.520
for being the younger generation's
role model in the imperial court.

03:53.360 --> 03:54.720
Thank you, Chancellor Jiang.

03:55.480 --> 03:56.320
Mr. Shen.

03:57.240 --> 03:59.480
This is a token from us.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.640
Please accept it.

04:03.080 --> 04:05.040
Thank you, Chancellor.
Thank you, Madam Ji.

04:07.440 --> 04:09.800
Next month is the hairpin ceremony
of our daughter.

04:09.880 --> 04:11.160
You're welcome

04:11.960 --> 04:13.320
to attend.

04:14.200 --> 04:15.160
It'll be a great honor.

04:18.360 --> 04:20.320
I should leave now.

04:21.240 --> 04:22.440
All right.

04:23.120 --> 04:25.320
- Please see Mr. Shen off.
- Yes.

04:27.480 --> 04:28.440
This way, please.

04:32.720 --> 04:34.320
My lady, should I put this over here?

04:34.800 --> 04:36.400
Yes, just put it over there.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.320
All right.

04:38.280 --> 04:39.320
Put these here.

04:41.440 --> 04:42.800
Be careful.

04:43.280 --> 04:44.320
Slowly.

04:45.760 --> 04:47.760
Put this over there.

04:47.840 --> 04:48.800
All right.

04:52.960 --> 04:54.840
- Mr. Shen. This way, please.
- Put more there.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.760
Mr. Shen.

05:00.560 --> 05:01.440
All right.

05:21.400 --> 05:22.960
My lady, Xiangqiao is here.

05:24.080 --> 05:24.960
Xiangqiao.

05:25.040 --> 05:26.000
Have a seat.

05:27.000 --> 05:28.000
I…

05:28.800 --> 05:30.280
You've had a hectic day.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.200
Have a seat.

05:32.680 --> 05:33.720
All right.

05:41.360 --> 05:42.200
Open it.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.200
My lady.

05:44.280 --> 05:46.360
- Again, you're giving…
- Take it.

05:48.440 --> 05:49.360
Thank you, my lady.

05:53.880 --> 05:54.840
This…

05:54.920 --> 05:56.320
This is too expensive.

05:56.400 --> 05:58.160
There's more to come.

05:59.680 --> 06:01.160
What did I do to deserve it?

06:02.320 --> 06:03.160
Well…

06:03.240 --> 06:04.120
Thank you, my lady.

06:04.720 --> 06:05.680
Xiangqiao.

06:06.240 --> 06:08.800
You need to look after
the flowers in this garden.

06:08.880 --> 06:11.480
Dry weather lets heat accumulate
in the body more easily.

06:11.560 --> 06:13.080
Chrysanthemum dispels heat.

06:13.160 --> 06:15.000
When you have time,
pick some chrysanthemums

06:15.080 --> 06:17.120
in the yard, and sundry them to make tea.

06:18.920 --> 06:20.400
I know.

06:20.480 --> 06:22.600
I was going to do that for you today,

06:22.680 --> 06:24.480
but his lordship had a guest.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.560
Madam Ji asked me to help out,

06:26.640 --> 06:27.520
so I forgot about it.

06:28.600 --> 06:30.640
Who was the visitor?

06:31.200 --> 06:32.520
Everyone's running around for him.

06:33.200 --> 06:35.120
It's Mr. Shen Yurong.

06:40.240 --> 06:41.080
My lady.

06:41.640 --> 06:42.880
I'm not that thirsty.

06:45.880 --> 06:49.280
Is the Mr. Shen you mentioned

06:51.720 --> 06:54.560
the top scorer
whose wife just passed away?

06:54.640 --> 06:55.480
Yes.

06:55.560 --> 06:57.480
Mr. Shen is the recent
imperial exam's top scorer.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.160
His lordship thinks highly of him.

06:59.240 --> 07:00.680
He is even invited

07:00.760 --> 07:02.080
to Ms. Ruoyao's hairpin ceremony.

07:02.560 --> 07:03.480
Is that so?

07:03.560 --> 07:04.480
That's right.

07:05.200 --> 07:08.120
It's a pity that his wife had bad morals.

07:08.200 --> 07:10.200
She met with her lover
behind Mr. Shen's back

07:10.280 --> 07:12.160
and even wanted to escape
after being discovered.

07:12.240 --> 07:13.240
Guess what happened?

07:13.800 --> 07:15.080
She fell off a cliff.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.000
Serves her right!

07:16.840 --> 07:18.960
Poor Mr. Shen, he was so devoted to her.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.880
He didn't eat or drink
for three days and nights

07:20.960 --> 07:22.840
after hearing about his wife's death.

07:25.240 --> 07:26.640
Mr. Shen

07:29.720 --> 07:31.560
is so sentimental.

07:31.640 --> 07:34.480
But maybe there is divine justice.

07:34.560 --> 07:36.600
His Majesty values affection and loyalty.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.680
In appreciation of Mr. Shen's devotion,

07:38.760 --> 07:40.320
His Majesty even issued a decree
to praise him.

07:40.400 --> 07:42.560
I heard His Majesty

07:42.640 --> 07:44.000
values him even more now.

07:44.760 --> 07:47.520
It's a blessing in disguise.

07:50.320 --> 07:51.160
I…

07:54.920 --> 07:56.120
see.

07:57.360 --> 07:58.920
- Mr. Shen--
- Xiangqiao.

07:59.480 --> 08:01.560
Shouldn't you
take care of the flowers now?

08:02.520 --> 08:03.520
I'm not done talking.

08:03.600 --> 08:05.120
It's all right, go.

08:05.200 --> 08:06.080
I'll see you off.

08:06.960 --> 08:07.920
- The bangle!
- The bangle.

08:08.920 --> 08:10.520
- My lady, I'll go ahead.
- Let's go.

08:11.320 --> 08:12.440
I'll tell you about it later.

08:20.280 --> 08:21.120
Miss.

08:22.480 --> 08:23.320
Miss.

08:23.880 --> 08:25.080
What's wrong, Miss?

08:31.400 --> 08:32.320
Tong'er.

08:33.520 --> 08:35.240
The Mrs. Shen she just mentioned

08:38.159 --> 08:42.120
whom everyone knows
as a woman with bad morals

08:43.720 --> 08:46.240
who had a lover

08:54.520 --> 08:55.800
is me.

08:56.920 --> 08:59.240
I thought
it was an ordinary family dinner.

09:00.040 --> 09:02.760
It's been a long time
since we got together for a meal.

09:02.840 --> 09:04.360
I was busy with the book compilation

09:04.440 --> 09:05.920
and neglected my family.

09:06.000 --> 09:08.200
My lady, thank you for your attentiveness.

09:08.280 --> 09:10.760
Thank you also to Mother
and Ruyun for helping out.

09:10.840 --> 09:13.040
Here. Let's raise our cups.

09:13.120 --> 09:15.400
May my son have a prosperous career ahead

09:15.480 --> 09:16.720
and bring honor to our ancestors.

09:20.480 --> 09:21.400
Xue Li.

09:21.880 --> 09:25.480
Why is everyone's drinking wine,
but you're drinking tea?

09:27.720 --> 09:28.600
Mother.

09:29.400 --> 09:31.360
I'm not feeling well today.

09:31.440 --> 09:33.080
I'll drink tea instead of wine.

09:33.160 --> 09:35.040
Just a sip.

09:35.760 --> 09:37.120
Xue Li isn't feeling well.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.680
There's no need to force her, Mother.

09:43.120 --> 09:44.400
Xue Li.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.840
Just do Mother a favor

09:45.920 --> 09:47.200
and have a drink.

09:47.680 --> 09:49.400
A grown son cannot be kept for long.

09:49.480 --> 09:50.720
My son is ungrateful.

09:50.800 --> 09:52.440
He always takes other people's other side.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.600
We're a family.

09:55.120 --> 09:56.200
Mother, don't talk nonsense.

09:57.600 --> 09:58.720
Mother.

09:58.800 --> 10:00.200
I was not feeling well

10:00.760 --> 10:02.000
and offended you.

10:03.160 --> 10:04.920
Today is a day of celebration.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.320
We must be happy.

10:36.640 --> 10:40.080
Who knew that the wine was drugged?

10:42.000 --> 10:44.280
Shen Yurong brought me back to the room.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.560
When I woke up…

11:07.600 --> 11:08.800
Who are you?

11:08.880 --> 11:09.720
Dear.

11:09.800 --> 11:11.920
I once suspected

11:12.000 --> 11:14.120
that Mr. Shen's mother
and daughter set me up.

11:15.240 --> 11:17.000
But I never thought

11:19.320 --> 11:23.400
that Shen Yurong knew about it.

11:24.760 --> 11:25.920
I understand, Miss.

11:26.800 --> 11:27.760
I do.

11:28.480 --> 11:31.520
I thought her ladyship was the most
miserable person in the world.

11:32.240 --> 11:33.600
Little did I know that you…

11:35.800 --> 11:37.000
I was blind.

11:39.760 --> 11:43.520
In the end, I even got my father

11:44.440 --> 11:45.400
and brother

11:47.160 --> 11:48.520
killed too.

11:50.680 --> 11:54.000
All of these are blood debts.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.800
The heavens' justice will prevail.

11:59.080 --> 12:00.120
Those evildoers

12:01.240 --> 12:03.480
must be punished.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.800
All right, Miss.

12:07.840 --> 12:08.880
I'll help you.

12:10.200 --> 12:11.480
I'll surely help you.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.000
Tong'er.

12:22.800 --> 12:23.640
Tong'er.

12:27.160 --> 12:29.240
Since the people who framed Jiang Li and I

12:29.960 --> 12:31.680
will turn up at the hairpin ceremony,

12:32.200 --> 12:34.560
we need to change our plan.

12:36.160 --> 12:37.200
What will we do?

12:37.800 --> 12:40.040
Showing up at the hairpin ceremony
is not enough.

12:44.840 --> 12:45.680
Tong'er.

12:46.400 --> 12:49.560
Do you remember
how Li'er's hairpin ceremony was done?

12:50.720 --> 12:53.400
Her ladyship didn't have
a hairpin ceremony.

12:57.800 --> 12:59.880
Then we will give
a hairpin ceremony for Jiang Li.

13:00.680 --> 13:01.600
We'll give her one?

13:02.160 --> 13:03.040
Yes.

13:04.400 --> 13:06.480
Jiang Li risked her life to save me.

13:07.120 --> 13:09.840
Now that I've returned to the capital
and Jiang Residence,

13:11.000 --> 13:14.080
I must give Li'er the life
she was supposed to have.

13:15.080 --> 13:16.200
Ms. Jiang Li

13:16.960 --> 13:19.080
was a distinguished woman.

13:20.160 --> 13:22.360
She deserves to stand
in front of everyone in the capital.

13:22.440 --> 13:24.280
She deserves praise and blessings.

13:27.800 --> 13:28.640
Tong'er, that's why

13:29.480 --> 13:30.840
the hairpin ceremony that day

13:30.920 --> 13:32.520
isn't only for Jiang Ruoyao,

13:33.440 --> 13:34.760
but also for Li'er.

13:36.520 --> 13:39.080
I will make Jiang Li return to her place

13:39.160 --> 13:41.120
in a dignified manner.

13:42.480 --> 13:43.600
But Miss,

13:44.080 --> 13:45.240
that's too hard.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.800
Ji Shuran will surely stop you.

13:49.880 --> 13:51.080
No matter how hard it is,

13:51.880 --> 13:53.200
we must do it for Li'er.

13:53.880 --> 13:56.640
If Shen Yurong sees you this way again…

13:58.160 --> 14:00.040
As long as I show up
at the hairpin ceremony,

14:01.520 --> 14:04.840
my identity as Jiang Li
will be indisputable.

14:06.360 --> 14:08.280
Even if Shen Yurong suspects me,

14:09.160 --> 14:11.040
he'll never dare
to make trouble in Jiang Residence.

14:13.520 --> 14:15.680
The destinies of Jiang Li and I
are intertwined.

14:17.720 --> 14:18.840
She will help me

14:19.480 --> 14:20.960
as she's looking down from above.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.440
She'll make that person

14:27.000 --> 14:28.920
meet me again

14:30.480 --> 14:33.840
in the capital's most prestigious family.

14:44.880 --> 14:46.040
I'm finally done.

14:46.920 --> 14:48.840
I never thought

14:48.920 --> 14:51.560
that pruning chrysanthemums
would be so hard.

14:55.680 --> 14:57.320
Look, all the sunny spots

14:57.400 --> 14:59.000
are taken up by the small garden.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.720
There's no sunlight elsewhere,

15:00.800 --> 15:01.920
so it causes dampness easily.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.760
Xiangqiao.

15:04.840 --> 15:08.080
Do you know other places
in the residence that get more sunlight?

15:09.560 --> 15:10.440
Tong'er.

15:10.520 --> 15:11.760
You came to the right person.

15:12.560 --> 15:14.560
There's plenty of sunshine
in the courtyard there.

15:14.640 --> 15:15.640
Then let's put them there.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.920
We're just drying chrysanthemums.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.680
Or do you want to stop working

15:23.760 --> 15:26.240
after receiving the rare,

15:26.320 --> 15:27.800
one-of-a-kind white jade bangle?

15:28.520 --> 15:30.240
That's nonsense.

15:30.320 --> 15:31.680
Then let's dry
the chrysanthemums together.

15:32.440 --> 15:33.800
Wait, Tong'er.

15:45.080 --> 15:46.080
Do you know how to do it?

15:47.440 --> 15:48.640
Do it again.

15:52.440 --> 15:53.440
Be elegant

15:53.960 --> 15:55.280
when placing the chrysanthemums.

16:01.680 --> 16:02.520
Stop.

16:02.600 --> 16:03.960
What are you doing?

16:04.040 --> 16:05.200
Are you slacking off?

16:05.760 --> 16:07.080
I saw Lord Jiang.

16:07.160 --> 16:08.920
I'm thinking of bowing to him.

16:13.000 --> 16:13.960
My lord.

16:14.720 --> 16:15.840
Get out of the way.

16:20.280 --> 16:21.120
My lord.

16:21.600 --> 16:22.760
How is Li'er doing?

16:23.320 --> 16:24.600
- She--
- She's doing good.

16:26.640 --> 16:28.280
You talk too much.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.680
Stay out of this.

16:31.040 --> 16:32.240
Yes.

16:33.960 --> 16:36.480
She's doing well,
but needs to dispel heat in her body.

16:36.560 --> 16:37.720
That's why

16:37.800 --> 16:39.560
we're drying chrysanthemums to make tea.

16:40.440 --> 16:41.560
I dried them all.

16:41.640 --> 16:42.480
Look.

16:43.720 --> 16:45.920
No wonder they look ugly.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.440
And you even dared to mention it.

16:47.520 --> 16:48.600
Redo them.

16:51.920 --> 16:52.760
Yes.

17:34.680 --> 17:35.600
What's wrong?

17:36.640 --> 17:37.480
It's nothing.

17:38.400 --> 17:41.040
The new emperor
just ascended the throne today.

17:41.520 --> 17:43.840
The imperial court's affairs
are complicated.

17:43.920 --> 17:45.760
I'm just a bit troubled.

17:46.640 --> 17:48.760
I just made sun-dried chrysanthemum tea.

17:49.240 --> 17:50.800
It can clear the mind
and brighten the eyes.

18:03.640 --> 18:06.200
No wonder it has a pleasant smell.

18:06.760 --> 18:08.560
It's good as long as
it can relieve your fatigue.

18:54.920 --> 18:55.760
Father.

19:00.960 --> 19:01.840
Li'er.

19:02.680 --> 19:06.560
Did you plant
these thinly scattered chrysanthemums?

19:06.640 --> 19:07.720
Yes, Father.

19:08.360 --> 19:12.040
I planted
these thinly scattered chrysanthemums.

19:16.120 --> 19:19.200
Mother used to look after the flowers
and plants with great care.

19:19.800 --> 19:21.360
I didn't learn well from her.

19:22.000 --> 19:25.160
Mother often said
that chrysanthemums are proud.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.320
It's elegant and upright.

19:27.400 --> 19:29.160
Chrysanthemums stand out
in the cold autumn,

19:30.120 --> 19:31.240
like a gentleman.

19:31.800 --> 19:33.080
Just like you.

19:33.160 --> 19:34.200
Li'er.

19:34.280 --> 19:36.280
I didn't think you'd remember this.

19:40.840 --> 19:42.240
Where are you going?

19:42.920 --> 19:44.680
We're going…

19:44.760 --> 19:45.840
- there.
- There.

19:47.360 --> 19:48.200
There.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.880
I don't think you need to go anywhere.

19:52.720 --> 19:54.200
We actually want…

19:54.280 --> 19:55.160
- to pee.
- To pee.

19:55.240 --> 19:56.160
Yes.

19:58.400 --> 20:00.200
I also need to pee.

20:00.280 --> 20:01.840
- Can you go now?
- Yes.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.960
- Well…
- Let's go together.

20:03.040 --> 20:04.400
- How can we go together?
- Well…

20:10.320 --> 20:11.160
Father.

20:11.640 --> 20:13.040
They went to get some snacks.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.320
Do you want to visit my courtyard?

20:16.120 --> 20:17.120
No.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.720
I need to go to the palace.

20:19.800 --> 20:20.760
Then…

20:21.320 --> 20:22.880
Father, can you help me

20:22.960 --> 20:24.320
bring some snacks to Grandmother?

20:24.880 --> 20:26.880
That day, I disturbed her.

20:27.360 --> 20:28.560
I feel guilty.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.400
It's not entirely your fault.

20:33.640 --> 20:34.520
Forget it.

20:34.600 --> 20:36.080
I'll sit with you for a while.

20:36.960 --> 20:38.400
GAZEBO

20:38.480 --> 20:39.360
Father.

20:39.840 --> 20:40.720
Please taste

20:40.800 --> 20:43.440
the premium chrysanthemum tea
I grew myself.

20:48.600 --> 20:49.600
Don't beat me!

20:49.680 --> 20:50.520
Don't beat me.

20:50.600 --> 20:51.440
Li'er.

20:51.520 --> 20:53.520
Don't. I'll never do it again.

20:53.600 --> 20:55.160
- Li.'er
- I won't do it again.

20:55.240 --> 20:56.200
What's wrong?

20:59.560 --> 21:00.400
Li'er.

21:03.520 --> 21:04.400
It's…

21:06.040 --> 21:06.920
It's nothing.

21:07.480 --> 21:08.320
All right.

21:08.400 --> 21:09.640
It's all right now, Li'er.

21:11.400 --> 21:12.600
Don't be afraid.

21:12.680 --> 21:14.080
All right, don't be afraid.

21:17.760 --> 21:19.200
I'm here.

21:20.000 --> 21:21.120
Be honest with me.

21:23.840 --> 21:25.440
When I was in Zhennv Hall,

21:27.480 --> 21:29.160
sometimes I got beaten up and punished

21:31.680 --> 21:35.200
if I didn't finish my work.

21:36.400 --> 21:38.000
And I…

21:39.880 --> 21:41.160
Let me see.

21:45.880 --> 21:46.960
Right.

21:47.760 --> 21:49.880
You're all grown up.
You're a big girl now.

21:51.000 --> 21:53.480
But you will always be my daughter.

21:55.440 --> 21:57.800
How dare Zhennv Hall treat you so harshly!

22:02.720 --> 22:03.680
Father.

22:05.880 --> 22:07.320
I'm home.

22:08.280 --> 22:11.840
As long as you come here often

22:11.920 --> 22:13.600
for flower viewing and tea tasting,

22:14.680 --> 22:16.480
I'd feel contented.

22:18.440 --> 22:19.280
Li'er.

22:40.800 --> 22:41.720
What is this?

22:42.640 --> 22:44.480
I embroidered it at Zhennv Hall.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.440
I didn't dare to show you before.

22:47.280 --> 22:48.680
I'm afraid that you…

22:51.400 --> 22:55.200
I'm afraid that you'd be ashamed of me.

23:06.040 --> 23:08.120
Did Li'er embroider this for Old Madam?

23:08.680 --> 23:10.440
Do you know what Li'er's life had been

23:10.520 --> 23:12.240
in Zhennv Hall?

23:13.480 --> 23:15.000
To get enough to eat,

23:15.640 --> 23:18.600
she was forced to steal some insoles

23:18.680 --> 23:19.760
and exchange them for money.

23:21.240 --> 23:23.200
If word gets out about this,

23:23.760 --> 23:26.960
people will ridicule the legitimate
daughter of the Jiang family

23:27.040 --> 23:29.920
for not even having enough to eat.

23:30.960 --> 23:33.200
The person in charge
must have withheld the money.

23:33.280 --> 23:34.200
My lord.

23:34.280 --> 23:35.840
I'll ask someone to teach her a lesson.

23:36.600 --> 23:37.520
Dear.

23:40.680 --> 23:44.160
Do you know she has scars on her body?

23:45.400 --> 23:46.800
Scars?

23:47.360 --> 23:50.000
She was beaten up at Zhennv Hall.

23:50.640 --> 23:54.880
She has scars all over her body.

23:55.880 --> 23:59.440
I've been busy
with the hairpin ceremony these days,

23:59.520 --> 24:00.520
so I neglected her.

24:01.360 --> 24:03.480
I failed as a mother.

24:03.560 --> 24:05.120
I failed to win her heart.

24:06.000 --> 24:07.600
She doesn't tell me anything.

24:08.560 --> 24:09.760
She told you instead

24:10.560 --> 24:12.160
and you had to remind me.

24:13.480 --> 24:14.760
I really owe her.

24:15.240 --> 24:18.640
That is not what pains me the most
from what I heard today.

24:20.160 --> 24:22.840
She's afraid that I'm ashamed of her.

24:23.440 --> 24:25.040
How could she think so?

24:26.960 --> 24:27.920
This girl

24:28.440 --> 24:29.760
keeps everything from me.

24:30.320 --> 24:32.800
She just doesn't dare
to get too close to you.

24:34.840 --> 24:36.640
Since you mentioned the hairpin ceremony,

24:37.480 --> 24:39.120
let Li'er attend.

24:39.760 --> 24:42.680
We owe her so much over the years.

24:43.200 --> 24:46.360
We can't break her heart again.

24:46.440 --> 24:47.520
It's just that Li'er

24:48.040 --> 24:50.640
never attended any banquets.

24:50.720 --> 24:52.320
And no one taught her the rules.

24:52.800 --> 24:55.720
I'm worried that she will make a fool
of herself at the ceremony.

24:55.800 --> 24:57.200
It will freak her out instead.

24:58.840 --> 25:00.560
The daughter of the Jiang family

25:00.640 --> 25:02.440
will have to meet people sooner or later.

25:03.000 --> 25:03.920
Think about it.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.120
If word gets out

25:06.200 --> 25:07.840
about what happened to her in Zhennv Hall,

25:07.920 --> 25:10.600
and we erased her name
from the hairpin ceremony,

25:10.680 --> 25:13.400
how would we clear our reputation

25:13.480 --> 25:14.520
for poor parenting?

25:16.080 --> 25:16.920
All right.

25:17.440 --> 25:19.760
I'll make some preparations.

25:20.800 --> 25:22.120
Thank you, dear.

25:41.440 --> 25:42.360
Morons!

25:42.840 --> 25:44.800
Madam Ji told you a thousand times

25:44.880 --> 25:46.360
not to let Jiang Li meet his lordship.

25:47.280 --> 25:48.880
You can't even handle something trivial.

25:48.960 --> 25:50.080
What's the use of keeping you?

25:50.160 --> 25:51.960
I wasn't aware.

25:54.520 --> 25:55.400
It's Xiangqiao.

25:55.480 --> 25:57.040
She covets petty profits.

25:57.120 --> 25:58.680
Jiang Li gave her some money

25:58.760 --> 26:00.320
and she helped her with a lot of things.

26:00.400 --> 26:02.000
She was also responsible

26:02.080 --> 26:03.960
for drying chrysanthemums.

26:04.040 --> 26:05.720
I really didn't have the slightest idea.

26:05.800 --> 26:07.920
If I knew, I'd surely stop them.

26:08.000 --> 26:09.120
Xiangqiao.

26:10.000 --> 26:11.040
Is this true?

26:13.840 --> 26:15.840
Please understand, Ms. Sun, Madam Ji.

26:15.920 --> 26:16.920
I only approached her

26:17.000 --> 26:18.160
to gain her trust

26:18.240 --> 26:19.600
and get information.

26:19.680 --> 26:21.160
The chrysanthemum tea incident

26:21.240 --> 26:23.120
would never have happened

26:23.200 --> 26:25.680
if Tong'er hadn't followed me.

26:28.880 --> 26:30.480
Madam Ji, don't worry.

26:30.560 --> 26:32.080
After this incident,

26:32.160 --> 26:34.640
Jiang Li will trust me more.

26:34.720 --> 26:36.520
It will be easier for you

26:36.600 --> 26:37.600
to do things from now on.

26:39.400 --> 26:42.880
Madam Ji, Jiang Li gave these to me.

26:42.960 --> 26:45.160
I was about to hand them over to you.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.840
Keep them.

26:56.400 --> 26:57.360
Yes.

27:00.000 --> 27:01.680
If you can gain her trust,

27:01.760 --> 27:03.760
this defeat isn't considered a bad thing.

27:04.920 --> 27:06.880
If this happens again next time,

27:06.960 --> 27:11.200
you won't just lose your monthly salary.

27:11.960 --> 27:13.160
- All right.
- All right.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.440
Shameless.

27:19.000 --> 27:19.880
You loathe me?

27:19.960 --> 27:21.240
You wanted Madam Ji to punish me?

27:22.640 --> 27:23.600
And what happened?

27:23.680 --> 27:25.480
Instead of punishing me,

27:25.560 --> 27:28.960
Madam Ji even let me keep my gifts.

27:30.000 --> 27:31.200
You'd better watch out.

27:31.760 --> 27:33.280
If Madam Ji punishes me again
because of you,

27:33.360 --> 27:34.240
I won't spare you.

27:36.440 --> 27:37.320
Let me tell you.

27:37.920 --> 27:39.560
If you speak ill of me
in front of Madam Ji again,

27:39.640 --> 27:40.520
I won't spare you.

27:42.360 --> 27:43.960
You're probably just feeling guilty.

27:44.040 --> 27:46.440
Don't think I don't know
what you did in Jiang Li's room.

27:46.520 --> 27:47.560
What did I do?

27:48.680 --> 27:51.160
You're just jealous that I'm more likable.

27:51.240 --> 27:53.120
I can please Madam Ji and Ms. Jiang Li.

27:53.200 --> 27:54.400
But you can't.

27:55.200 --> 27:56.080
Naturally,

27:56.160 --> 27:58.320
these gifts are all mine.

28:02.040 --> 28:02.880
- Madam Ji.
- Madam Ji.

28:04.400 --> 28:05.240
You're shameless!

28:05.320 --> 28:06.840
- You…
- What?

28:06.920 --> 28:08.920
You always look bitter.
Who would like you?

28:09.000 --> 28:10.560
Nobody likes you,
so you take it out on me.

28:10.640 --> 28:11.920
If I look bitter,

28:12.000 --> 28:13.400
then you have a flat face.

28:13.480 --> 28:14.480
You…

28:15.760 --> 28:16.880
When Madam Ji's around,

28:16.960 --> 28:17.840
you always bark at me.

28:19.680 --> 28:21.600
- You're calling me a dog?
- Yes, that's right.

28:21.680 --> 28:23.000
All right.

28:23.080 --> 28:24.960
Then I'll bite you to death today.

28:27.360 --> 28:29.120
- You mad dog!
- I'll bite you to death!

28:29.600 --> 28:30.440
You mad dog!

28:30.520 --> 28:31.800
FANGFEI COURTYARD

28:33.000 --> 28:35.160
Jiang Li has been home for several days,

28:35.240 --> 28:36.760
but we haven't seen her come out.

28:37.680 --> 28:39.160
Is she shy

28:39.240 --> 28:41.640
or someone won't let her out?

28:41.720 --> 28:42.560
You're so smart.

28:43.080 --> 28:44.800
Mind your own business.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.040
Li'er liked running around

28:59.120 --> 29:00.520
when she was little.

29:01.240 --> 29:03.120
Rui'er also liked playing with her.

29:03.680 --> 29:06.720
But it's true that girls
become very different when they grow up.

29:06.800 --> 29:07.680
When Li'er was little,

29:07.760 --> 29:10.040
her face was chubby.

29:10.120 --> 29:11.840
She's elegant and graceful now.

29:11.920 --> 29:14.160
If I run into her on the street,

29:14.680 --> 29:16.600
I might not be able to recognize her.

29:17.320 --> 29:19.400
If you have time to be concerned
about your niece,

29:19.480 --> 29:21.120
be concerned more about your son.

29:21.680 --> 29:23.400
The Annual Exam will be held soon.

29:23.480 --> 29:25.000
Judging from his laziness now,

29:25.080 --> 29:27.680
I'll see how you explain to Old Madam

29:27.760 --> 29:29.760
if he is expelled from school.

29:30.680 --> 29:31.760
My lady.

29:31.840 --> 29:33.480
Aren't you in charge of this matter?

29:33.560 --> 29:35.360
Why are you leaving it to me now?

29:36.000 --> 29:38.120
I want to be in charge and fix this.

29:38.200 --> 29:40.120
- But who does he take after?
- My lady, don't!

29:40.200 --> 29:41.920
- Stop. You're making me mad!
- Don't hit me.

29:42.000 --> 29:42.840
Stop!

29:44.240 --> 29:46.000
Miss, you're incredible.

29:46.680 --> 29:48.480
His Lordship must have
said something to Ji Shuran.

29:48.560 --> 29:50.400
She sent so many supplements

29:50.480 --> 29:51.360
and gifts today.

29:52.720 --> 29:53.720
It looks so nice.

30:01.680 --> 30:02.720
It's yours now.

30:04.200 --> 30:05.320
Thank you, Miss.

30:08.000 --> 30:08.960
It's a beauty.

30:16.400 --> 30:18.520
Miss, a monster's over there.

30:24.840 --> 30:27.280
You're a big girl
and you're afraid of a tortoise?

30:32.800 --> 30:39.680
Show mercy!

30:46.360 --> 30:47.200
Jiang Jingrui,

30:47.680 --> 30:50.920
son of your Second Uncle, his lordship's
legitimate brother, Jiang Yuanping,

30:51.000 --> 30:52.640
the most facetious person in the family.

30:52.720 --> 30:55.040
Overdramatic, noisy, silly,

30:55.120 --> 30:57.320
and undisciplined are his descriptions.

30:57.400 --> 30:59.520
People call him Little Ruirui.

31:03.000 --> 31:04.160
Show mercy!

31:05.160 --> 31:06.000
Show mercy.

31:09.280 --> 31:10.680
My dear little tortoise.

31:10.760 --> 31:12.680
Are you all right? Did they hurt you?

31:12.760 --> 31:13.600
It's fine.

31:13.680 --> 31:14.520
It's all right.

31:20.640 --> 31:21.480
Hello, Jingrui.

31:38.040 --> 31:41.000
You are not Jiang Li.

31:41.720 --> 31:42.560
Young Master.

31:42.640 --> 31:44.160
What do you mean?

31:44.240 --> 31:45.800
My cousin, what are you saying?

31:46.360 --> 31:47.360
"Cousin"?

31:47.440 --> 31:49.360
You call me your cousin?

31:49.440 --> 31:50.760
Jiang Jingrui?

31:53.240 --> 31:54.760
Little Ruirui?

31:55.680 --> 31:57.120
That's more like it!

31:57.200 --> 31:58.920
Your serious look just now

31:59.000 --> 32:01.120
gave me goosebumps all over.

32:01.200 --> 32:02.480
It sounded so cheesy.

32:02.560 --> 32:04.040
You gave me this nickname

32:04.120 --> 32:05.880
when you were little.

32:05.960 --> 32:07.080
Your sudden seriousness

32:07.160 --> 32:08.560
made me so uncomfortable.

32:08.640 --> 32:09.720
I thought

32:09.800 --> 32:11.080
I would never see you again.

32:11.160 --> 32:12.120
You're not aware.

32:13.120 --> 32:14.400
Ever since you left,

32:15.560 --> 32:18.000
I had been crying every day.

32:18.080 --> 32:19.440
I was devastated

32:19.520 --> 32:21.320
and heartbroken.

32:22.000 --> 32:25.760
I could only depend
on the little tortoise.

32:27.480 --> 32:29.200
Fortunately, Uncle Yuanbai
has a conscience

32:29.280 --> 32:30.120
and brought you back.

32:31.240 --> 32:32.760
Thanks for your concern, Little Ruirui.

32:32.840 --> 32:34.040
You're welcome. Have a seat.

32:34.560 --> 32:35.520
You too.

32:37.440 --> 32:38.280
But…

32:39.040 --> 32:40.600
if you don't want to get kicked out again,

32:40.680 --> 32:41.800
you have to be smart.

32:41.880 --> 32:43.960
Thanks for the reminder, Little Ruirui.

32:44.040 --> 32:46.520
Has Jiang Ruoyao given you any problems?

32:47.480 --> 32:49.840
I haven't seen her since I got home.

32:50.680 --> 32:53.680
But I'd been away from home
for a long time.

32:53.760 --> 32:55.720
Why would she give me problems?

32:56.400 --> 32:58.320
Both of you like Zhou Yanbang.

32:58.840 --> 33:00.600
- Zhou Yanbang?
- Have you forgotten?

33:00.680 --> 33:02.520
You and Zhou Yanbang
were engaged since childhood.

33:02.600 --> 33:03.760
After you were sent away,

33:03.840 --> 33:05.600
the family replaced Jiang Ruoyao
in the engagement.

33:05.680 --> 33:06.560
Now you are back.

33:06.640 --> 33:08.760
Jiang Ruoyao does not bear any grudges?

33:08.840 --> 33:09.880
I think

33:09.960 --> 33:11.840
we shouldn't attend the hairpin ceremony.

33:11.920 --> 33:13.200
Think about it.

33:13.280 --> 33:15.280
You and Zhou Yanbang
can't be together anymore.

33:15.360 --> 33:17.120
It doesn't matter how awful you feel.

33:17.200 --> 33:21.400
You'll watch Zhou Yanbang and Jiang Ruoyao
flirt in front of so many guests.

33:21.480 --> 33:23.240
How would you feel?
You will feel terrible.

33:23.320 --> 33:24.840
Then you will complain.

33:24.920 --> 33:27.960
And you'll embarrass yourself
at the hairpin ceremony.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.880
Tong'er, I'm tired.

33:29.960 --> 33:31.280
Please see the guest off.

33:31.880 --> 33:32.760
All right.

33:32.840 --> 33:33.720
Let's go.

33:41.840 --> 33:42.760
Remember that.

33:43.880 --> 33:44.880
Hurry.

33:45.640 --> 33:46.520
No need to see me off.

34:06.040 --> 34:08.719
- My lady. Are you going out?
- My lady.

34:09.480 --> 34:12.159
Ruoyao's hairpin ceremony
is in a few days.

34:12.239 --> 34:13.600
I'll go out and get a gift for her.

34:14.199 --> 34:15.040
It's dirty.

34:15.920 --> 34:16.920
- It's dirty here too.
- It's dirty here too.

34:17.520 --> 34:18.440
My lady.

34:18.520 --> 34:20.159
All coachmen in the residence

34:20.239 --> 34:21.280
are out today.

34:21.760 --> 34:23.360
Maybe another day?

34:24.520 --> 34:26.360
You can also write down
what you want to buy.

34:26.440 --> 34:27.920
- We'll get it for you.
- Right.

34:29.840 --> 34:30.920
Xiangqiao.

34:31.000 --> 34:32.560
Get me a carriage outside.

34:34.679 --> 34:35.760
I…

34:35.840 --> 34:37.920
I'm afraid I can't get one now.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.639
Can you wait a couple more days?

34:40.960 --> 34:43.560
Yunshuang, can you do it?

34:43.639 --> 34:45.040
- I…
- As long as you can do it,

34:45.120 --> 34:47.280
it doesn't matter how much money it takes.

34:56.800 --> 34:57.640
Yunshuang.

34:59.240 --> 35:02.080
You're anxious about Ms. Ruoyao's event.

35:02.640 --> 35:03.600
I'll get a carriage now.

35:03.680 --> 35:04.960
Wait a minute.

35:05.040 --> 35:06.080
Thank you.

35:07.600 --> 35:08.600
Yunshuang.

35:09.200 --> 35:11.160
I'll leave this place to you.

35:12.040 --> 35:14.120
I have a task to do.

35:26.640 --> 35:27.960
My rare pearl!

35:29.440 --> 35:32.000
Look how happy you are.
You can't even keep your balance.

35:40.800 --> 35:43.920
JIANG RESIDENCE

35:52.360 --> 35:55.280
ZHOU YANBANG

35:55.360 --> 35:57.200
Look, I got you a large carriage.

35:57.680 --> 35:58.640
It's so nice.

36:01.440 --> 36:02.360
Mr. Zhou.

36:16.360 --> 36:17.200
My lady.

36:25.400 --> 36:27.160
On your head…

36:36.000 --> 36:36.840
Thank you.

36:37.840 --> 36:42.240
Xiangqiao, you still need to water
the flowers in the courtyard today.

36:42.320 --> 36:44.080
You don't have to go shopping with me.

36:44.160 --> 36:46.120
- Tong'er.
- My lady, I'll…

36:53.560 --> 36:54.520
My lady.

36:54.600 --> 36:55.520
My lady.

36:59.600 --> 37:01.040
Who was that person?

37:02.760 --> 37:03.960
It's Ms. Jiang Li.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.480
Ms. Jiang Li?

37:08.080 --> 37:09.080
Is that Jiang Li?

37:12.040 --> 37:12.920
Yes.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.200
Ms. Ruoyao.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.840
JIANG RUOYAO

37:29.200 --> 37:30.080
Yanbang.

37:31.160 --> 37:32.920
What were you looking at?

37:34.280 --> 37:37.000
I heard from the maid
that your sister is back.

37:39.560 --> 37:41.160
What's the matter? Do you want to see her?

37:41.240 --> 37:44.200
How about I ask her to meet you later?

37:45.240 --> 37:46.600
I'm just saying.

37:47.160 --> 37:49.240
I remember you two were engaged.

37:49.760 --> 37:52.600
How about you cancel our marriage

37:52.680 --> 37:54.200
and get back to her?

37:55.920 --> 37:57.520
Why are you mad?

37:57.600 --> 37:59.480
Jiang Li has been
in Zhennv Hall for many years.

37:59.560 --> 38:01.040
She's ignorant and vulgar.

38:01.720 --> 38:03.160
How can she compare to you?

38:03.720 --> 38:05.440
Look, I even bought you

38:05.520 --> 38:06.640
your favorite pastries.

38:06.720 --> 38:07.920
I queued up for a long time.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.600
Come on, let's go to school.

38:09.680 --> 38:10.640
Don't be upset. Let's go.

38:20.240 --> 38:22.840
My lord, I've dispatched secret guards
to search Qingcheng Mountain.

38:22.920 --> 38:24.600
The search will probably take
two more days.

38:25.440 --> 38:26.320
That's too slow.

38:26.800 --> 38:27.720
We're short-handed.

38:27.800 --> 38:30.200
We can only mobilize
some of His Majesty's secret guards.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.720
Do it.

38:31.800 --> 38:33.440
I don't have to worry then, my lord.

38:38.080 --> 38:39.240
Jiang Li is out.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.680
She finally can't take it anymore.

38:46.040 --> 38:47.760
- Continue following her.
- Yes.

39:05.200 --> 39:06.200
Tong'er.

39:06.280 --> 39:08.160
I'll go and pick a gift for Jiang Ruoyao.

39:09.120 --> 39:11.160
Go to the pawnshop
and redeem something for me.

39:12.320 --> 39:13.280
Got it.

39:15.200 --> 39:16.080
Miss.

39:16.160 --> 39:18.040
These are the famous
and valuable goods here.

39:18.600 --> 39:19.520
Have a look.

39:22.640 --> 39:24.920
This is the calligraphy scroll
given to us by Mr. Shen,

39:25.000 --> 39:26.840
the recent top scorer.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.640
It is worth its weight in gold.

39:29.720 --> 39:31.000
Like gold dust.

39:31.640 --> 39:33.440
Mr. Shen is not only good at calligraphy,

39:33.520 --> 39:34.840
but also has a good character.

39:34.920 --> 39:36.640
He will become a good official

39:36.720 --> 39:39.200
who works for the welfare of the people.

39:39.840 --> 39:42.480
Yes. His handwriting is clear
and elegant, it's great indeed.

39:42.560 --> 39:44.080
- You're right.
- Look at this.

39:53.040 --> 39:55.400
BY SHEN YURONG IN EARLY MAY

39:55.480 --> 39:57.960
SHEN YURONG

40:04.080 --> 40:05.240
Please take a look at this.

40:05.320 --> 40:06.920
This is also a rare treasure.

40:14.200 --> 40:15.280
Mrs. Shen?

40:15.800 --> 40:16.760
But…

40:19.120 --> 40:19.960
Mrs. Shen.

40:20.040 --> 40:20.880
You…

40:21.440 --> 40:22.960
This is obviously very valuable.

40:23.600 --> 40:24.880
Who is Mrs. Shen?

40:25.480 --> 40:26.400
- You have a taste.
- Well…

40:26.480 --> 40:28.120
Isn't she Ms. Jiang Li,
who just came back?

40:28.800 --> 40:29.840
It's really her.

40:29.920 --> 40:31.120
We didn't see her last time.

40:31.800 --> 40:33.120
She is really pretty.

40:33.720 --> 40:35.000
Sir, I'm ready to pay.

40:36.000 --> 40:36.840
Well…

40:43.160 --> 40:44.000
Take care, my lady.

40:57.000 --> 40:57.960
Miss.

40:59.320 --> 41:01.680
Someone bought the civet pendant
you asked me to redeem.

41:03.680 --> 41:04.720
Who bought it?

41:09.840 --> 41:11.960
Ms. Jiang Li went to the pawnshop
to redeem this.

41:12.480 --> 41:14.200
I informed the shopkeeper in advance,

41:14.280 --> 41:15.480
as you instructed.

41:15.560 --> 41:17.760
We'll take whatever she wants to redeem.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.640
Who pawned it?

41:20.400 --> 41:23.200
The owner said it was a married woman,

41:23.280 --> 41:25.720
but he couldn't remember the details.

41:26.400 --> 41:28.280
A married woman?

41:31.320 --> 41:33.040
The shopkeeper said it was Duke Su.

41:33.120 --> 41:35.280
He also said
that he is now in the tea house.

41:37.120 --> 41:38.280
How weird.

41:38.840 --> 41:40.480
Why is he eyeing our things?

41:41.240 --> 41:42.960
He is not eyeing our things.

41:44.480 --> 41:45.640
He's targeting me.

41:47.160 --> 41:48.680
Miss.

41:49.560 --> 41:50.640
Miss, stay calm.

41:51.320 --> 41:52.440
He's Duke Su.

41:52.520 --> 41:53.640
We can't mess with him.

41:54.200 --> 41:56.280
Why would the shopkeeper mention

41:56.360 --> 41:57.560
that he's in the tea house?

41:58.120 --> 41:59.480
He's inviting us there.

42:00.480 --> 42:01.520
Not going

42:02.320 --> 42:04.280
would be foolish and disrespectful.

42:04.360 --> 42:05.560
Why retreat?

42:06.760 --> 42:07.600
Besides,

42:08.160 --> 42:11.000
I have to get the pendant back.

42:12.040 --> 42:13.520
Sorry, I'm late, guys.

42:14.960 --> 42:16.120
Have a seat.

42:17.560 --> 42:19.560
You must drink as punishment.

42:19.640 --> 42:20.600
Sure.

42:20.680 --> 42:21.920
Three shots for me.

42:23.760 --> 42:24.720
My lady, please stop.

42:24.800 --> 42:26.200
The private room upstairs is taken.

42:26.280 --> 42:27.200
You can't go in.

42:28.560 --> 42:29.440
The dishes are served.

42:29.520 --> 42:31.440
Please let the guest know

42:31.520 --> 42:33.960
that Ms. Jiang Li
is honoring his invitation.

42:34.040 --> 42:34.920
I'm here.

42:35.480 --> 42:37.200
- Sit here.
- What a great day.

42:37.280 --> 42:38.640
You're late today.

42:39.280 --> 42:40.160
It's all right.

42:40.640 --> 42:41.800
Come, sit down, please.

42:55.480 --> 42:56.640
Greetings, Duke Su.

42:58.760 --> 43:00.360
I wonder why you were looking for me.

43:01.920 --> 43:03.600
The waiter said you were looking for me.

43:04.160 --> 43:06.440
You asked the shopkeeper of the pawnshop
to send a message.

43:07.040 --> 43:08.120
I dare not refuse to come.

43:08.680 --> 43:11.520
Besides, you're still holding the jade
pendant my maid wants to redeem.

43:11.600 --> 43:13.800
I don't have a maid's jade pendant.

43:15.080 --> 43:16.880
The shopkeeper of the pawnshop told me

43:17.440 --> 43:18.640
it belonged to a married woman.

43:20.120 --> 43:20.960
Her name…

43:22.120 --> 43:23.000
is Li.

43:24.640 --> 43:27.280
You won't marry anyone else but him?

43:27.920 --> 43:28.800
Yes.

43:31.840 --> 43:34.320
Your mother left this
when she passed away.

43:34.920 --> 43:35.880
She said

43:35.960 --> 43:38.480
it must be given to you
when you get married.

43:39.320 --> 43:41.520
It will keep you safe
and make your life smooth.

43:42.960 --> 43:46.200
Since you've made up your mind, take it.

43:48.680 --> 43:51.400
Go. Remember, don't be shy to tell us

43:52.120 --> 43:53.320
if you encounter difficulties.

43:54.520 --> 43:56.480
You will always be my daughter.

44:00.680 --> 44:01.640
Father.

44:04.920 --> 44:05.840
Ms. Jiang Li.

44:07.720 --> 44:08.760
Ms. Jiang Li.

44:11.600 --> 44:15.200
This belonged to an old friend,
who already passed away.

44:15.840 --> 44:16.960
I can't tell you about it.

44:18.080 --> 44:19.640
You've been in Zhennv Hall for years.

44:20.240 --> 44:21.800
Where did this old friend come from?

44:23.160 --> 44:26.160
Duke Su, this is personal.

44:28.120 --> 44:30.440
All right. Then tell me.

44:31.400 --> 44:35.160
Why did your old friend pawn it?

44:43.960 --> 44:44.840
Madam Xue.

44:45.360 --> 44:47.400
Your husband overworked himself.

44:47.480 --> 44:48.480
He needs to rest.

44:48.560 --> 44:50.560
It'll take at least three months
for him to recover.

44:50.640 --> 44:51.560
That won't do.

44:52.360 --> 44:54.080
He'll take
the Palace Examination in a month.

44:54.760 --> 44:56.080
Is there any other way?

44:56.160 --> 44:59.040
Caterpillar fungus nourishes
the body well.

44:59.120 --> 45:00.720
But it's not something

45:00.800 --> 45:03.160
ordinary people can afford.

45:29.600 --> 45:32.360
LI

45:37.960 --> 45:39.560
Why this face again?

45:40.800 --> 45:41.960
Ms. Jiang Li.

45:43.360 --> 45:47.040
Where exactly is this jade pendant from?

45:48.640 --> 45:50.000
The affairs of the deceased

45:51.200 --> 45:52.920
is not worth mentioning.

45:54.080 --> 45:56.080
Please return the jade pendant to me,
Duke Su.

45:57.120 --> 45:58.920
Tell me how much you want for it.

46:01.520 --> 46:02.680
Do I look like I'm short of money?

46:03.640 --> 46:05.200
What do you want then?

46:05.920 --> 46:08.000
I haven't gotten the answer I need.

46:08.560 --> 46:09.800
That day at Zhennv Hall,

46:11.480 --> 46:13.520
I had no choice but to use you.

46:13.600 --> 46:15.400
Please forgive me

46:16.040 --> 46:17.360
and return the jade pendant to me.

46:17.920 --> 46:19.080
Don't be so nervous.

46:20.640 --> 46:23.480
Otherwise, I would think

46:25.160 --> 46:28.440
this is a token of love
given to you by your lover.

46:31.760 --> 46:32.800
As I said before,

46:33.600 --> 46:34.680
I do not know him.

46:37.360 --> 46:38.480
How about this?

46:39.040 --> 46:39.960
Tell me.

46:41.040 --> 46:44.600
Where did Mr. Qin hide
the evidence of his crime?

46:46.080 --> 46:47.320
If you speak the truth,

46:48.240 --> 46:49.520
I'll give it back to you.

46:51.280 --> 46:52.120
All right?

46:52.680 --> 46:53.880
Again.

46:53.960 --> 46:55.200
I don't know Mr. Qin.

47:13.320 --> 47:14.440
Stop horsing around, my lord.

47:14.520 --> 47:16.160
Finding the evidence is more important.

47:16.680 --> 47:19.440
If it's not found in Qingcheng Mountain,
is there any other way?

47:19.520 --> 47:22.720
Are you looking for what the man hid

47:23.800 --> 47:25.240
when he burst into Zhennv Hall?

47:26.920 --> 47:28.400
If I tell you

47:28.480 --> 47:29.800
where it is hidden,

47:30.600 --> 47:32.720
will you return my jade pendant?

47:33.280 --> 47:34.120
Tell me about it.

47:34.680 --> 47:36.200
It's in the backyard of Zhennv Hall.

47:36.840 --> 47:37.920
How can you prove it?

47:38.560 --> 47:40.040
He had fruit puree marks on his hand.

47:44.080 --> 47:45.440
There is a tree in the backyard.

47:46.600 --> 47:47.720
It was windy those days.

47:48.280 --> 47:50.040
There were a lot of windfalls.

47:50.640 --> 47:52.280
Those fruits are like mulberries.

47:52.360 --> 47:53.920
They dye your fingers if you touch them.

47:54.000 --> 47:55.800
You can't remove it for several days.

47:56.360 --> 47:57.800
He dug that part of the land.

48:00.040 --> 48:01.240
How do you know

48:02.800 --> 48:04.480
he didn't get it somewhere else?

48:06.840 --> 48:08.680
I stayed at Zhennv Hall for ten years.

48:09.640 --> 48:12.480
I know very well that the fruits there
are different from other places.

48:13.960 --> 48:15.440
That's a good excuse.

48:20.480 --> 48:21.960
I'm telling the truth.

48:32.080 --> 48:35.120
Duke Su, please return
the jade pendant to me.

48:37.240 --> 48:38.200
What's the rush?

48:39.320 --> 48:40.960
We will know the answer soon.

49:34.480 --> 49:36.000
My lord, we found it.

49:40.960 --> 49:42.400
I've been out for quite a while.

49:42.960 --> 49:46.040
Duke Su, please return
the jade pendant to me.

49:47.400 --> 49:48.560
I have to hurry home.

49:54.160 --> 49:55.120
Duke Su.

50:20.160 --> 50:21.440
You really won't ask

50:21.520 --> 50:23.000
how your lover is doing?

50:23.920 --> 50:25.360
He's still in my hands.

50:26.880 --> 50:27.800
It seems like

50:28.440 --> 50:30.160
you're still suspecting

50:30.240 --> 50:31.920
that I have a relationship with Mr. Qin.

50:32.560 --> 50:33.560
Why?

50:34.720 --> 50:35.560
Don't you?

50:36.120 --> 50:37.720
That day, I had a knife put to my throat.

50:39.120 --> 50:41.800
I already told you
everything I know today.

50:42.520 --> 50:43.640
Do you call that a relationship?

50:44.240 --> 50:46.160
Is that greater
than one's life and future?

50:46.920 --> 50:48.400
Duke Su, where is your brain?

50:58.520 --> 50:59.440
Did you

51:00.400 --> 51:02.200
just call me brainless?

51:02.280 --> 51:03.240
Yes.

51:05.400 --> 51:06.440
You're brainless.

51:07.880 --> 51:09.200
A woman's reputation matters.

51:09.280 --> 51:10.720
There's no way you don't know that.

51:12.000 --> 51:14.320
My shelter was broken into for no reason.

51:15.520 --> 51:17.440
The intruder became the lover

51:19.600 --> 51:20.840
and I became a lascivious woman.

51:22.720 --> 51:25.120
While you're talking and laughing,
my reputation is ruined.

51:25.920 --> 51:27.200
What's worse is

51:29.080 --> 51:34.000
giving a dog a bad name and hanging him.

51:36.600 --> 51:38.600
Are you trying to force me to die?

51:43.680 --> 51:45.440
I can't prove my innocence.

51:47.600 --> 51:48.920
If you think

51:49.440 --> 51:51.280
I have an affair with your criminal,

51:53.640 --> 51:55.240
just head to Jiang Residence

51:56.280 --> 51:57.520
and lock me up.

52:17.640 --> 52:18.800
What's that look for?

52:18.880 --> 52:19.840
Why?

52:19.920 --> 52:22.720
My lord, is there something wrong
with the look in our eyes?

52:24.400 --> 52:26.040
Go back and get ten canes.

52:26.600 --> 52:27.560
Why?

52:28.120 --> 52:29.160
You gave me a filthy look.

52:35.200 --> 52:37.000
Do you think I went too far?

52:37.720 --> 52:38.920
I dare not say that.

52:40.840 --> 52:41.800
It's fine to say it.

52:42.280 --> 52:44.120
I also think I'm quite shameless.

52:45.960 --> 52:47.960
But if I wasn't shameless,

52:48.040 --> 52:49.800
I couldn't force the truth out of her.

52:49.880 --> 52:51.760
Do we need to continue following her?

52:54.320 --> 52:55.520
There's no need.
